WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.022
A synthetic support form. Form Rescue isn't enabled here yet.

2
00:00:03.022 --> 00:00:06.251
Enable protection for this site. It gets access to this one site only.

3
00:00:06.251 --> 00:00:12.096
Write as usual.

4
00:00:12.096 --> 00:00:14.308
About a second after a pause, the draft is committed to this browser.

5
00:00:14.308 --> 00:00:16.754
The page refreshes, and the text is gone.

6
00:00:16.754 --> 00:00:18.463
Form Rescue has a saved draft for this page.

7
00:00:18.463 --> 00:00:20.062
Review drafts opens a page the website can't see.

8
00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:22.990
Compare what was saved with what's on the page, and choose what to restore.

9
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:24.999
Nothing is restored until you confirm.

10
00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:27.608
Your words are back.
